      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\r\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span><span class=\"time\">150 min</span><span class=\"chip\">Interview page</span><span class=\"chip\">163 filterable Q&amp;A</span><span class=\"chip\">40 marked must-know</span></div>\r\n  <h1>LLD Question Bank (150+ Q&amp;A)</h1>\r\n  <p class=\"lead\">Every kind of question an LLD or machine-coding round throws at you, in one filterable place: OOP, SOLID, UML, all three pattern families, concurrency, case-study follow-ups and the round itself. Each has a short model answer, how to say it, and the follow-ups that usually come next.</p>\r\n  <p>108 of the 163 questions link to at least one self-reported interview on <a href=\"https://leetcode.com/discuss/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LeetCode Discuss</a> (company and post date, no author names). The rest are the standard follow-ups those reports and our topic pages lead to. Reported at <span class=\"chip\">Amazon</span> <span class=\"chip\">Uber</span> <span class=\"chip\">Swiggy</span> <span class=\"chip\">Flipkart</span> <span class=\"chip\">Microsoft</span> <span class=\"chip\">Walmart</span> <span class=\"chip\">Atlassian</span> <span class=\"chip\">PhonePe</span> and more.</p>\r\n"
  },
